Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Wax Seals Melt Across the Fader
- Story & Context: When a courier rig overturned during the dry crossing at Bir-Zidane, sound-trader Tariq dragged an iron crate of unopened state telegraph letters into the shade of a salvaged Roland JP-8000 sound-rig. The sticky smell of scorched phenolic resin filled the tent as a red wax-stamped envelope wedged into an exposed transformer, shorting the circuit and transforming a placid lo-fi loop into a roaring 152 BPM distorted kick with an offbeat dancehall bounce. Amina seized her dented brass horn to harmonize with the electrical sparking, bellowing into the rising sandstorm while the chorus toasted through the smoke: "Read the dispatch before the bass drum burns the paper." By nightfall, the caravan had abandoned the cargo salvage to dance around the smoking fader bank until the quartz dust cooled.
